{"id":"6c405a6e3532b689","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Arithmetical Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set — ZFC Recursion2 Arithmetical Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set — ZFC Recursion2 Arithmetical Set","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set — ZFC Recursion2 Arithmetical Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba4c98699a906790\" href=\"?note=ba4c98699a906790\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (candidate subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S\\)</span> (lightface hierarchy-level predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba4c98699a906790\" href=\"?note=ba4c98699a906790\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ArithmeticalSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ArithmeticalSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ArithmeticalSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S(n,\\Gamma)\\land A\\in\\Gamma\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ArithmeticalSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S(n,\\Gamma)\\land A\\in\\Gamma\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The lightface hierarchy is used: number parameters are permitted, but no arbitrary real parameter is implicit.</li>\n<li>The existential level is finite; hence this is the union of the lightface arithmetical hierarchy, not the analytical hierarchy.</li>\n<li>The hierarchy classes are supplied by the canonical recursive level construction rather than by undeclared symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_n\">\\(\\Pi^0_n\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4c98699a906790","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4c98699a906790","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S$ (lightface hierarchy-level predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ArithmeticalSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ArithmeticalSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S(n,\\Gamma)\\land A\\in\\Gamma\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_n","display":false}],"bytes":1402,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-arithmetical-set]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ba4c98699a906790"]}